{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351430","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035143001:0":{"text":"제 남편 델빅은 안야에게 장난감을 사주고 싶어해요.","source_cn":"我的丈夫德尔维克想要给安妮娅买个玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x593EE243C4BE8FDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035143002:0":{"text":"하지만 성석 마을 상점에는 물건이 없고, 앞쪽에 특별한 시장이 하나 있다고 하더라고요...","source_cn":"圣石镇的商店中缺货，我们听说前方有一个特别的市场——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D1328300CB12B2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035143003:0":{"text":"진귀한 물건을 구할 수 있는 그런 시장이요. 그래서 남편은 그곳에 희망을 걸어보기로 했어요.","source_cn":"可以买到各种珍贵的东西，德尔维克就决定去碰碰运气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0357BC5A9A5BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035143004:0":{"text":"아이를 위한 그이의 마음을 이해해서 말릴 수 없었어요... 듀라 님께 그가 무사히 돌아오기를 빌 수 밖에요...","source_cn":"我劝不动他，只能向艾雅祈祷……保佑他平安抵达，安全返回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1E3DDDF1F501FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民菲利帕":{"text":"마을 주민 필리파","source":"镇民菲利帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}